{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1459681-into-the-labyrinth-akd-expansion-fanbook","id":1459681,"title":"Into the Labyrinth- AKD Expansion Fanbook","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-09-11T12:56:12-07:00","id":1459681,"title":"Into the Labyrinth- AKD Expansion Fanbook","content":"So originally I wanted to make it into a STV product, but my sister is still stuck on the art for some previous project which makes it ever more likely that this will just sit down in my google docs and rot away- so I decided to, at the very least, put it here on the forums so people could enjoy it. If it will be well received (and the art pipeline would finally clear) I may release it to the STV, but this could also be an opportunity to get some feedback on it and see what needs to be changed- because I did went <i>wild</i> with some of the concepts here. In short, in this doc, you will find all kinds of new features for an AKD focused chronicle, including new Endowments, history, special mechanics, factions, monsters and tons of other cool stuff. In order to access the document,<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1-jTz6voLF7RgOkoQbHbD8bfiQRHjsr0dg0YtpkTGGCQ/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> just click the link here</a>.<br /> <br /> Please let me know what you are thinking, and I hope you'll like it!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-11T15:10:12-07:00","id":1459698,"title":"","content":"Are the Paragons like... Anti Slashers? While Slashers are so goddang dedicated to kill that they become tougher Paragons are so goddang dedicated to hunting they become tougher?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-11T18:05:15-07:00","id":1459709,"title":"","content":"That's an impressive chunk of work. I had some headcannon going that linked early Iremite relics, Atlantean artifacts, and fetishes around the Aegean to Mycenaean and Minoan relic hunters whose descendants eventually coalesced into the AKD around 1000 BCE after locating the Athenian Vault (which also tied in to the founding of Athens around the same time). I also had the vault as a relic that itself conceals relics from outside and is locatable by a keystone relic that led the proto-AKDs to it. It's not nearly as developed as what you've done, and I love to see people this kind of thought into the worldbuildling, especially when it doesn't seem likely we'll get to see something similar from OP. Thank you for building and sharing it.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2096-willywonka","name":"willywonka","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-12T00:12:19-07:00","id":1459730,"title":"","content":"Skimmed through, seems really cool, but the paragon seems extremely ambitious. Like t really gives a supernatural bent to the Vigil, and what a lot of people, me included&quot; like about Hunter the Vigil is that, unlike Reckoning, Hunters are very much human even with their warped morality/integrity<br /> <br /> Not that I'm against it. I actually really like the idea considering Slashers. But I don't know how'd it be seen my others.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-12T02:22:52-07:00","id":1459737,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1459681-into-the-labyrinth-akd-expansion-fanbook?p=1459698#post1459698\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are the Paragons like... Anti Slashers? While Slashers are so goddang dedicated to kill that they become tougher Paragons are so goddang dedicated to hunting they become tougher?</div> </div> </div> </div>It is a valid interpretation! Indeed, paragons are people who embody their Code/Vigil in a way which it, in a way, manifest itself through them, making them into its vessels, which makes them intoo a bright mirror for the slasher existence. On the other hand, they also have some resemblance to Deviants, especially the more &quot;advanced&quot; ones which are a part of a conspiracy, as they are basically a tool of their organization- only instead of a broken soul, they draw power from the collective Vigil of their group. Basically, they are people with a messed up soul, yet instead of having it broken (like deviants) or dead (like slashers), paragons have theirs &quot;weaved&quot; into a &quot;collective soul&quot; of some kind- and how much they actually lose their soul in their process and have the Vigil replacing it is a question which they may prefer to not ask themselves. But that's just how I view them, you could use them however you want!<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-12T02:33:46-07:00","id":1459738,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1459681-into-the-labyrinth-akd-expansion-fanbook?p=1459730#post1459730\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Skimmed through, seems really cool, but the paragon seems extremely ambitious. Like t really gives a supernatural bent to the Vigil, and what a lot of people, me included&quot; like about Hunter the Vigil is that, unlike Reckoning, Hunters are very much human even with their warped morality/integrity<br /> <br /> Not that I'm against it. I actually really like the idea considering Slashers. But I don't know how'd it be seen my others.</div> </div> </div> </div>There are two main reasons I've made paragons- the first is that there are people who want a more &quot;supernatural hunter&quot;, someone with a bit of buff against monsters. That's however, not the main reason- the prime reason was that I needed an heroic template to represent the champion in the Vigil Ascended scenario, where someone has to embody the ancient battle which would bring a new golden age. That idea made me thinking about other potential &quot;champions&quot; of other conspiracies, with the idea was having only one such paragon per organization, being a vessel of the conspiracy's goals, means and desires which (in certain conditions) could change the world. However, it then occurred to me that some people are interested in having a &quot;supernaturally buffed hunter&quot;, and that making a more generalized paragon which could then be customized to represent different compacts, conspiracies and chapters (or just be left as a &quot;tier one paragon&quot;) could be something that people may like to see, especially considering that people do like customized splats, like Deviant. So I divided it into &quot;tiers&quot;, with reserving the most epic form for the &quot;Conspiracy Theory/Vigil Ascended&quot; scenario and having a general &quot;supernatural hunter&quot; as the base, allowing versatility in choosing the exact power level of their paragon.<br /> <br /> So yeah, it was more like &quot;I have this cool idea for this very specific scenario&quot; which I decided to generalize to make it more useful beyond that specific case of someone recreating the Labyrinth of the Isle and fighting Asterion and the Mistress while being watched by nine beheaded people.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-12T08:52:53-07:00","id":1459754,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1459681-into-the-labyrinth-akd-expansion-fanbook?p=1459738#post1459738\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There are two main reasons I've made paragons- the first is that there are people who want a more &amp;quot;supernatural hunter&amp;quot;, someone with a bit of buff against monsters. That's however, not the main reason- the prime reason was that I needed an heroic template to represent the champion in the Vigil Ascended scenario, where someone has to embody the ancient battle which would bring a new golden age. That idea made me thinking about other potential &amp;quot;champions&amp;quot; of other conspiracies, with the idea was having only one such paragon per organization, being a vessel of the conspiracy's goals, means and desires which (in certain conditions) could change the world. However, it then occurred to me that some people are interested in having a &amp;quot;supernaturally buffed hunter&amp;quot;, and that making a more generalized paragon which could then be customized to represent different compacts, conspiracies and chapters (or just be left as a &amp;quot;tier one paragon&amp;quot<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> could be something that people may like to see, especially considering that people do like customized splats, like Deviant. So I divided it into &amp;quot;tiers&amp;quot;, with reserving the most epic form for the &amp;quot;Conspiracy Theory/Vigil Ascended&amp;quot; scenario and having a general &amp;quot;supernatural hunter&amp;quot; as the base, allowing versatility in choosing the exact power level of their paragon.<br /> <br /> So yeah, it was more like &amp;quot;I have this cool idea for this very specific scenario&amp;quot; which I decided to generalize to make it more useful beyond that specific case of someone recreating the Labyrinth of the Isle and fighting Asterion and the Mistress while being watched by nine beheaded people.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ahh ok. Yeah I can see that, and I admit I do like the idea that the collective soul is empowering them. I assume this means they can't even be a paragon if they hunted alone though, right? <br /> <br /> Also, it REALLY makes me think of Heroes from beast, it seems to be the same power source (astral) but different cause for it","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-12T14:07:54-07:00","id":1459765,"title":"","content":"I like the idea of chapters a lot, however I do see one issue (well, for lack of better word) with it. Also would love to what the chapter equivalent of the Chieron Group<br /> <br /> While the history of the AKD is expanded upon and pretty damn dynamic, the supplement doesn't really go into the AKD itself, focusing all in on the chapters, which in turn gives them more character than the AKD at a glance.<br /> <br /> Is there a reason you chose to not have too big a focus on the organization of the AKD itself?<br /> <br /> Also, I really like the paradise found scenario. In your vision, should all conspiracies have a sorta chance for their version of the &quot;Golden ending&quot;?<br /> <br /> EDIT: is the Aztec chapter supposed to be the slasher cabal reflection of the AKD?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24173,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","user":"Primordial newcomer","date":". 09-12-2021, 05:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-12T14:45:16-07:00","id":1459771,"title":"","content":"I mostly focused on the Antagonists, but I loved what I read! Can I have your permission to repost your link on a few Discords? I know you're on the Onyx Path Publishing Discord, but you don't seem to post there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>~<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">\u266b</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7593-teatime","name":"Teatime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7593_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"750"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-12T15:10:14-07:00","id":1459773,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Teatime</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1459681-into-the-labyrinth-akd-expansion-fanbook?p=1459771#post1459771\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I mostly focused on the Antagonists, but I loved what I read! Can I have your permission to repost your link on a few Discords? I know you're on the Onyx Path Publishing Discord, but you don't seem to post there.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sure- just share the link to the forum post and not the link to the doc itself, if you may","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-12T15:21:04-07:00","id":1459775,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1459681-into-the-labyrinth-akd-expansion-fanbook?p=1459765#post1459765\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like the idea of chapters a lot, however I do see one issue (well, for lack of better word) with it. Also would love to what the chapter equivalent of the Chieron Group<br /> <br /> While the history of the AKD is expanded upon and pretty damn dynamic, the supplement doesn't really go into the AKD itself, focusing all in on the chapters, which in turn gives them more character than the AKD at a glance.<br /> <br /> Is there a reason you chose to not have too big a focus on the organization of the AKD itself?</div> </div> </div> </div>First- the chapters are the &quot;new thing&quot;, so it makes sense to give them some focus- but I wanted to emphasis that the chapters are a natural part of the AKD's formation. Personally, I don't think I didn't focus on the AKD itself- they are the Minoan Labyrinth Cult, they are the conspiracy which spread together with Alexander, they are the ones who had to deal with the Inquisition, the French Revolution and the Witch Trials. They are the ones who went to the New World, fought against the Tecuanimeh and celebrated in Nassau during the Golden Age of Piracy. The AKD are ever present in the history section- and the reason I didn't went too deep into the AKD as AKD is because you already have material about them in C&amp;C and the 1e Core, so I don't need to spend wordcount on that subject. The way that the conspiracy is built is detailed throughout the book, so again, I have focused on them- just introduced those new factions. It should be noted that while I gave &quot;chapters&quot; their name, the concept itself was introduced in canon (as the Order of the Black Knight is a canon organization), and the 2e core does mention the concept of &quot;rtegional variants&quot;, even if not giving them a name.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Also, I really like the paradise found scenario. In your vision, should all conspiracies have a sorta chance for their version of the &quot;Golden ending&quot;? </div> </div> </div>That's what I have in mind- even though for some it will be less &quot;golden&quot; than you can imagine. If I were to write such a supplement for each group, they'll all have their &quot;endgame&quot; where the conspiracy &quot;wins&quot;- such events will always change the world, but some may be more or less glorious than others, be it redeeming Satan, creating a new breed of humanity or submitting the human will over the otherworlds and its gods through the World Tree.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> EDIT: is the Aztec chapter supposed to be the slasher cabal reflection of the AKD? </div> </div> </div>Yep, they are the &quot;dark faction&quot; within the organization, being focused on serving blood gods- even though they do have their own &quot;Vigil&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-12T18:50:49-07:00","id":1459803,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1459681-into-the-labyrinth-akd-expansion-fanbook?p=1459775#post1459775\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">First- the chapters are the &amp;quot;new thing&amp;quot;, so it makes sense to give them some focus- but I wanted to emphasis that the chapters are a natural part of the AKD's formation. Personally, I don't think I didn't focus on the AKD itself- they are the Minoan Labyrinth Cult, they are the conspiracy which spread together with Alexander, they are the ones who had to deal with the Inquisition, the French Revolution and the Witch Trials. They are the ones who went to the New World, fought against the Tecuanimeh and celebrated in Nassau during the Golden Age of Piracy. The AKD are ever present in the history section- and the reason I didn't went too deep into the AKD as AKD is because you already have material about them in C&amp;C and the 1e Core, so I don't need to spend wordcount on that subject. The way that the conspiracy is built is detailed throughout the book, so again, I have focused on them- just introduced those new factions. It should be noted that while I gave &amp;quot;chapters&amp;quot; their name, the concept itself was introduced in canon (as the Order of the Black Knight is a canon organization), and the 2e core does mention the concept of &amp;quot;rtegional variants&amp;quot;, even if not giving them a name.<br /> <br /> <br /> That's what I have in mind- even though for some it will be less &amp;quot;golden&amp;quot; than you can imagine. If I were to write such a supplement for each group, they'll all have their &amp;quot;endgame&amp;quot; where the conspiracy &amp;quot;wins&amp;quot;- such events will always change the world, but some may be more or less glorious than others, be it redeeming Satan, creating a new breed of humanity or submitting the human will over the otherworlds and its gods through the World Tree.<br /> <br /> <br /> Yep, they are the &amp;quot;dark faction&amp;quot; within the organization, being focused on serving blood gods- even though they do have their own &amp;quot;Vigil&amp;quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Sorry for the late reply.<br /> <br /> Gotcha, you have a point about the labyrinths and the AKD history being focused solely on them. I think I'm just too focused on wanting to hear how they are operate now, which as you pointed out, is handled very well in C&amp;C. <br /> <br /> As for the golden ending, yeah I figured some weren't gonna be exactly &quot;good&quot; for humanity, but would show the conspiracy CAN succeed in what it wants to do.<br /> <br /> Finally, I really like the idea of dark factions. Especially since the one you made shows the inherent dangers of humans messing with artifacts","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-27T04:58:47-07:00","id":1461663,"title":"","content":"I really want to download this","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26173-evtrax","name":"evtrax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-22T13:05:43-07:00","id":1464900,"title":"","content":"Will you providing an updated link or will that be for the actual product? I noticed antagonists and introduction are still under construction according to the list","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-04T09:26:32-07:00","id":1466660,"title":"","content":"I must have read the expansion three times already. I may be biased (HtV is my favorite game line and AKD my favorite conspiracy) but this expansion has some great ideas and you can see all of the hard work invested in it. Really cool.<br /> <br /> I particularly liked the concept of Paragons since they allow a whole diferent style of play (although street level Hunters will always be my favorite!). The idea of making each paragon not only diferent mechanics but also different origins and fluff gives them a lot of personality. \u00bfAre you thinking of making more Paragons for other conspiracies?<br /> <br /> The expansion has inspired me so much that I have already started a game that will eventually end with the Paradise Reclaimed scenario. Since this scenario assumes the AKD are right about their rigin story, which clashes with a lot of the known cosmology of the world, maybe later I will post how I'm planning to make it work so that others can comment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27168-aeneas","name":"Aeneas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27168_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-05T06:28:30-07:00","id":1466765,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1459681-into-the-labyrinth-akd-expansion-fanbook?p=1464900#post1464900\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Will you providing an updated link or will that be for the actual product? I noticed antagonists and introduction are still under construction according to the list</div> </div> </div> </div>If and when I'll finish this title, it would probably be in a STV format- so think about this as the &quot;95.8% complete manuscript preview&quot; OPP usually present in Kickstarters. I'm not getting it down, but it will not be updated in this link. It should be noted that I am currently not working on updating it, because I have a number of deadlines to deal with for my PhD.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aeneas</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">I must have read the expansion three times already. I may be biased (HtV is my favorite game line and AKD my favorite conspiracy) but this expansion has some great ideas and you can see all of the hard work invested in it. Really cool.<br /> <br /> I particularly liked the concept of Paragons since they allow a whole diferent style of play (although street level Hunters will always be my favorite!). The idea of making each paragon not only diferent mechanics but also different origins and fluff gives them a lot of personality. \u00bfAre you thinking of making more Paragons for other conspiracies?<br /> <br /> The expansion has inspired me so much that I have already started a game that will eventually end with the Paradise Reclaimed scenario. Since this scenario assumes the AKD are right about their rigin story, which clashes with a lot of the known cosmology of the world, maybe later I will post how I'm planning to make it work so that others can comment.</div> </div> </div> </div>First, I'm happy to hear you like it! Like, hopefully I would have time to make some Paragons for other grouyps, but again currently I'm currently chocked between deadlines and other projects rthat writing a bunch of new paragons takes a lower priority. As for the AKD Sovereignty scenario- while you could indeed play it as &quot;the AKD were right all along&quot; (and I would even recommend it for a AKD based game- it would make sense that the protagonists of the game do know what they are doing), this is not actually an assumption in that scenario. It doesn't matter if the origin myth for the AKD is correct or not as long as it serves as a system for their Sovereignty- those things are symbols, which, when assigned correctly, could change the world. The Labyrinths, Asterion and the Mistress of Honey are tools which the conspiracy uses to invoke their right to change the world, and the recreation of the battle between the gods and their Guardians is simply the key for their ascension, instead of serving as actual truth.<br /> <br /> If you are interested in my own headcanon for the origin of the AKD, check my STV title &quot;Dark Eras: Igniting the Fire&quot;- but expect that their origin myth is indeed more myth than reality in this product. That's of course, only their &quot;fallen&quot; origin- I have a... different representation for them in the Atlantis which never was. If only I would have enough time to complete that setting shard..","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-05T07:04:15-07:00","id":1466769,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1459681-into-the-labyrinth-akd-expansion-fanbook?p=1466765#post1466765\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If and when I'll finish this title, it would probably be in a STV format- so think about this as the &amp;quot;95.8% complete manuscript preview&amp;quot; OPP usually present in Kickstarters. I'm not getting it down, but it will not be updated in this link. It should be noted that I am currently not working on updating it, because I have a number of deadlines to deal with for my PhD.<br /> <br /> <br /> First, I'm happy to hear you like it! Like, hopefully I would have time to make some Paragons for other grouyps, but again currently I'm currently chocked between deadlines and other projects rthat writing a bunch of new paragons takes a lower priority. As for the AKD Sovereignty scenario- while you could indeed play it as &amp;quot;the AKD were right all along&amp;quot; (and I would even recommend it for a AKD based game- it would make sense that the protagonists of the game do know what they are doing), this is not actually an assumption in that scenario. It doesn't matter if the origin myth for the AKD is correct or not as long as it serves as a system for their Sovereignty- those things are symbols, which, when assigned correctly, could change the world. The Labyrinths, Asterion and the Mistress of Honey are tools which the conspiracy uses to invoke their right to change the world, and the recreation of the battle between the gods and their Guardians is simply the key for their ascension, instead of serving as actual truth.<br /> <br /> If you are interested in my own headcanon for the origin of the AKD, check my STV title &amp;quot;Dark Eras: Igniting the Fire&amp;quot;- but expect that their origin myth is indeed more myth than reality in this product. That's of course, only their &amp;quot;fallen&amp;quot; origin- I have a... different representation for them in the Atlantis which never was. If only I would have enough time to complete that setting shard..</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for the response! I'll be buying the finished product. And good luck on getting those deadlines done.<br /> <br /> Also I hope you can get to that shard. I really would like to know what they originally were in Atlantis from your perspective","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-06T05:05:19-07:00","id":1466929,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1459681-into-the-labyrinth-akd-expansion-fanbook?p=1466765#post1466765\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If you are interested in my own headcanon for the origin of the AKD, check my STV title &quot;Dark Eras: Igniting the Fire&quot;- but expect that their origin myth is indeed more myth than reality in this product. That's of course, only their &quot;fallen&quot; origin- I have a... different representation for them in the Atlantis which never was. If only I would have enough time to complete that setting shard..</div> </div> </div> </div>Bought it! ! will check it out when I have a little bit more time. I may still post my own view of the AKD origin in the whole cofd cosmos later.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27168-aeneas","name":"Aeneas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27168_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}